      "role": "follower",
      "text": "*The Eternal Champion stretches upward, fingertips brushing against the rough stone of the cell wall. The brass key rests on a ledge just beyond easy reach, its metal surface cool and slightly grimy to the touch. To secure it, the Nord Mage must extend fully or find a way to balance against the damp masonry.*",
