    {
      "id": "game_2204d9c1aa",
      "role": "follower",
      "text": "*The Eternal Champion's foot slides on the wet stone as momentum carries them forward. A sharp crack echoes through the cell as shoulders slam against the granite wall, breath escaping in a ragged gasp. The lunge sends the brass key skittering further along the ledge, now resting precariously near the edge where the torchlight cannot reach.*\n\n*Pain radiates from the impact, and the key sits tauntingly out of reach in the shadows. From the corridor beyond, the skittering of claws on stone grows louder, drawn by the sudden commotion.*",
