    {
      "id": "game_18a4f1b794",
      "role": "follower",
      "text": "*The guard's brow furrows as Brea's whispered plea drifts through the bars, his interest piqued by the promise of information. He leans in closer, the keys at his hip swaying within inches of Brea's outstretched fingers as he lowers his voice to a conspiratorial growl.*\n\nScraps, eh? Talk fast, girl, before I change my mind about being generous.\n\n*The guard's attention shifts momentarily to the Eternal Champion at the outburst, his hand tightening on his sword pommel as suspicion flickers across his face. The key ring dangles tantalizingly close to the iron bars, the metal cool and heavy as it sways with the guard's slight shift in weight.*",
