    {
      "id": "game_12b6dc006c",
      "role": "follower",
      "text": "*The guard's eyes narrow as he processes Brea's claim, his greed momentarily overriding caution. He leans further through the bars, the key ring now hanging directly before the gap where Brea's fingers probe. The Eternal Champion's exaggerated expressions draw the guard's attention for a split second, providing the perfect distraction as the leather strap gives way under Brea's deft touch.*\n\n*With a sudden, sharp tug, the key ring slides free from the guard's belt, clattering softly against the stone floor. The guard's face transforms from avarice to raw panic as he realizes he has been played.*\n\nYou thieving little—!\n\n*He scrambles backward, hand flying to his sword hilt as he recovers from the shock. The keys now lie just inside the cell, within reach of the prisoners, as the guard's face flushes crimson with rage and embarrassment.*",
