    {
      "id": "game_ce0fa4d263",
      "role": "follower",
      "text": "*The Eternal Champion's hand shoots forward, fingers closing around the cold iron of the key ring just as the guard's sword clears its scabbard. The heavy metal clatters against the cell floor, but the Nord Mage's grip is swift and sure, pulling the prize back toward the bars.*\n\n*The guard's eyes widen as he realizes he has been outplayed, his sword tip wavering between indignation and hesitation. He takes a stumbling step backward, the torchlight casting his shadow in jagged motion against the damp walls.*\n\nYou're dead! You'll rot in the deepest pit for this!\n\n*The keys feel heavy and solid in the Eternal Champion's palm, their jagged edges biting into skin. The lock on the cell door is just inches away, its rusted iron mechanism waiting for the right key to turn.*",
